    "detailed_description": "<strong>Hey guy !</strong> what's the Hell ? The kingdom is full of bad guys ! Put on your armor, take your sword and go clean it up<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Village</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067280/extras/6b1c71a356be8308c2992db8da6382cd.poster.avif?t=1753112036\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067280/extras/6b1c71a356be8308c2992db8da6382cd.webm?t=1753112036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067280/extras/6b1c71a356be8308c2992db8da6382cd.mp4?t=1753112036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Kick off the orcs and the goblins out of the castle and the village before they turn them into a hell fair !<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Graveyards</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067280/extras/e12786ce19903950b173a37a6917fb6d.poster.avif?t=1753112036\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067280/extras/e12786ce19903950b173a37a6917fb6d.webm?t=1753112036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067280/extras/e12786ce19903950b173a37a6917fb6d.mp4?t=1753112036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The dead are out of their graves. Send them back home !<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dark Castles</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067280/extras/8fcb49c6e5c477eab76a1d5818c131e7.poster.avif?t=1753112036\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067280/extras/8fcb49c6e5c477eab76a1d5818c131e7.webm?t=1753112036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067280/extras/8fcb49c6e5c477eab76a1d5818c131e7.mp4?t=1753112036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Find your way to the Beast and bring Gold and Peace Back !<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">New level begins its development : &quot;The Haunted Forest&quot;</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067280/extras/5e810d52c05bdebb58f4a534a604addc.poster.avif?t=1753112036\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067280/extras/5e810d52c05bdebb58f4a534a604addc.webm?t=1753112036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067280/extras/5e810d52c05bdebb58f4a534a604addc.mp4?t=1753112036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>You'll be in trouble with witches, pumpkin's, trolls, new bosses and the classic Orcs 'n Skeletons ! Devils 'n Dragons Arcade grows from month to month !<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>6 armor classes for the hero : improve your armor class power by killing, finding, collecting.<br></li><li>Get the right weapon for doing the job : weapons avaiable (sword, dagger, bomb, hammer, spear, axe, but also dart...)<br></li><li>Get spell protection : protection from evil, fire, normal missile, but also dispell magic and raise from the dead<br></li><li>Try your luck opening coffers<br></li><li>Avoid enemy sorcerers and their curse</li></ul><br>The game will enhance with new levels and monsters<br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067280/extras/e5aa3263132cc7c7f93cd3b00ac115c3.avif?t=1753112036\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Hey guy !</strong> what's the Hell ? The kingdom is full of bad guys ! Put on your armor, take your sword and go clean it up<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Village</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067280/extras/6b1c71a356be8308c2992db8da6382cd.poster.avif?t=1753112036\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067280/extras/6b1c71a356be8308c2992db8da6382cd.webm?t=1753112036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067280/extras/6b1c71a356be8308c2992db8da6382cd.mp4?t=1753112036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Kick off the orcs and the goblins out of the castle and the village before they turn them into a hell fair !<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Graveyards</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067280/extras/e12786ce19903950b173a37a6917fb6d.poster.avif?t=1753112036\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067280/extras/e12786ce19903950b173a37a6917fb6d.webm?t=1753112036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067280/extras/e12786ce19903950b173a37a6917fb6d.mp4?t=1753112036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The dead are out of their graves. Send them back home !<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dark Castles</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067280/extras/8fcb49c6e5c477eab76a1d5818c131e7.poster.avif?t=1753112036\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067280/extras/8fcb49c6e5c477eab76a1d5818c131e7.webm?t=1753112036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067280/extras/8fcb49c6e5c477eab76a1d5818c131e7.mp4?t=1753112036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Find your way to the Beast and bring Gold and Peace Back !<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">New level begins its development : &quot;The Haunted Forest&quot;</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067280/extras/5e810d52c05bdebb58f4a534a604addc.poster.avif?t=1753112036\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067280/extras/5e810d52c05bdebb58f4a534a604addc.webm?t=1753112036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067280/extras/5e810d52c05bdebb58f4a534a604addc.mp4?t=1753112036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>You'll be in trouble with witches, pumpkin's, trolls, new bosses and the classic Orcs 'n Skeletons ! Devils 'n Dragons Arcade grows from month to month !<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>6 armor classes for the hero : improve your armor class power by killing, finding, collecting.<br></li><li>Get the right weapon for doing the job : weapons avaiable (sword, dagger, bomb, hammer, spear, axe, but also dart...)<br></li><li>Get spell protection : protection from evil, fire, normal missile, but also dispell magic and raise from the dead<br></li><li>Try your luck opening coffers<br></li><li>Avoid enemy sorcerers and their curse</li></ul><br>The game will enhance with new levels and monsters<br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067280/extras/e5aa3263132cc7c7f93cd3b00ac115c3.avif?t=1753112036\" /></div>",
